### Case: no-key-registered — a partner whose key has never been stored.
### Expect 500 with the configured message, and NO document.
### This is the security case: with fail-open the backend's document would be
### returned in the clear to a caller who was supposed to receive ciphertext.
GET {{GATEWAY}}/partners/documents
X-Partner-Id: {{UNREGISTERED_PARTNER_ID}}
